+##
+# @x-fdisbull-render-raster-proof:
+#
+# Perform one synchronous standard VGA renderer update with the guest stopped,
+# then return the source proof for that update. Requires the same owner and
+# opt-in as the passive query, an exclusive headless console and no pending
+# screendump. The operation updates the renderer without running guest code
+# or publishing a timed display capture.
+#
+# Since: 10.0
